        <mxCell id="boundary_note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#475467;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Modeling boundary.&lt;/b&gt; Quotation, QuotationBatch, ContractCase, ProjectAssignment, ProcurementDecision,&lt;br&gt;and InvoiceExpectation are transient CPN data/control tokens, not OCEL object types. Contract status is represented by&lt;br&gt;the Purchase Order attribute &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;contract_mode&lt;/span&gt; (Existing or New). A cardinality of 0..1 reflects a path that may&lt;br&gt;terminate before the downstream object is created; every created downstream object references exactly one upstream object.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#98a2b3;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=25;" parent="1" vertex="1">
